@startuml ki-01-location-permission
title KI-01 / HU-29 — Blocked location permission: current problem and proposed fix (registration)
caption Wizard Step 1 follows the same idea with ReportWizardBloc, CurrentLocationRequested and GetCurrentLocationUseCase;\nits state has no GpsStatus enum (it uses isLocating + locationStatusMessage), so there the blocked case needs one bool field.

skinparam dpi 220
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBF2
autonumber

actor "Citizen" as U
box "UI" #F6EFE0
  participant "RegisterScreen" as S
  participant "RegisterBloc" as B
end box
box "Domain" #E8F0E8
  participant "DetectNearestCity\nUseCase" as DUC
  participant "OpenLocationSettings\nUseCase\n<<new>>" as OUC
  participant "LocationRepository\n<<contract>>" as R
  participant "CityRepository\n<<contract>>" as CR
end box
box "Data" #E3EAF0
  participant "LocationRepositoryImpl" as RI
  participant "LocationDataSource" as DS
end box
participant "Geolocator\n(SDK / OS)" as G

== PART 1 — THE PROBLEM (current code, Android 11+) ==
U -> G : taps "No permitir" twice in the OS location dialog
note over G : Android now answers\ndeniedForever ("don't ask again")

U -> S : taps "Detectar mi ciudad por GPS"
S -> B : add(NearestCityRequested())
B -> B : emit(gpsStatus: detecting)
B -> DUC : _detectNearestCity()
DUC -> R : currentCoordinates()
R -> RI : currentCoordinates()
RI -> DS : currentCoordinates()
DS -> G : isLocationServiceEnabled()
G --> DS : true
DS -> G : checkPermission()
G --> DS : deniedForever
DS --> RI : throw Exception("El permiso de ubicación está\nbloqueado. Usa la lista de ciudades.")
RI --> R : (propagates)
R --> DUC : (propagates)
DUC --> B : (propagates)
B -> B : on Exception catch (e)\nemit(gpsStatus: failure, gpsMessage: _message(e))
B --> S : new state
S -> U : same plain error text as any other GPS failure
note over U, B #F4D6CC
  <b>Dead end:</b> the OS will not show the dialog again,
  and the app has no way to open the system settings:
  no button, no use case, no repository method.
  Nothing reacts differently to the "blocked" message.
  The user must find the phone settings alone or reinstall.
end note

autonumber 1
== PART 2 — PROPOSED FIX (HU-29) ==
U -> S : taps "Detectar mi ciudad por GPS"
S -> B : add(NearestCityRequested())
B -> B : emit(gpsStatus: detecting)
B -> DUC : _detectNearestCity()
DUC -> R : currentCoordinates()
R -> RI : currentCoordinates()
RI -> DS : currentCoordinates()
DS -> G : isLocationServiceEnabled()
G --> DS : true
DS -> G : checkPermission()
G --> DS : deniedForever
DS --> RI : throw Exception(LocationRepository.blockedMessage)
RI --> R : (propagates)
R --> DUC : (propagates)
DUC --> B : (propagates)
B -> B : on Exception catch (e)\nemit(gpsStatus: _message(e) == LocationRepository.blockedMessage\n    ? GpsStatus.blocked : GpsStatus.failure,\n  gpsMessage: _message(e))
note right of B
  <b>changed:</b> the whole message is compared
  with the constant declared on the contract.
  GpsStatus gains one value: blocked.
end note
B --> S : new state
S -> U : AppNotice "El permiso de ubicación está bloqueado.\nToca \"Abrir ajustes\" y luego Permisos → Ubicación."\n+ button "Abrir ajustes" (only when gpsStatus == blocked)

group new: open the system settings
  U -> S : taps "Abrir ajustes"
  S -> B : add(LocationSettingsRequested())
  B -> OUC : _openLocationSettings()
  OUC -> R : openSettings()
  R -> RI : openSettings()
  RI -> DS : openSettings()
  DS -> G : openAppSettings()
  alt Android / iOS
    G --> DS : true
    G -> U : shows the app settings screen
    DS --> RI : true
    RI --> R : true
    R --> OUC : true
    OUC --> B : returns normally
    note right of B : no emit: the notice stays\nuntil the user retries
    U -> G : enables location, returns to VIGÍA
  else web (geolocator_web throws "unsupported"), or the OS returns false
    G --> DS : throws / false
    DS --> RI : false  (the data source catches the error)
    RI --> R : false
    R --> OUC : false
    OUC --> B : throw Exception("No pudimos abrir los ajustes.\nActiva la ubicación desde la configuración\nde tu navegador o teléfono.")
    B -> B : on Exception catch (e)\nemit(gpsStatus: failure, gpsMessage: _message(e))
    B --> S : new state
    S -> U : explanatory notice, button hidden, no crash
  end
end

group retry (existing flow, unchanged code)
  U -> S : taps "Detectar mi ciudad por GPS" again
  S -> B : add(NearestCityRequested())
  B -> B : emit(gpsStatus: detecting)
  B -> DUC : _detectNearestCity()
  DUC -> R : currentCoordinates()
  R -> RI : currentCoordinates()
  RI -> DS : currentCoordinates()
  DS -> G : isLocationServiceEnabled()
  G --> DS : true
  DS -> G : checkPermission()
  G --> DS : whileInUse
  DS -> G : getLastKnownPosition() ?? getCurrentPosition()
  G --> DS : Position
  DS --> RI : Coordinates
  RI --> R : Coordinates
  R --> DUC : Coordinates
  DUC -> CR : getCities()
  CR --> DUC : List<City>
  DUC -> DUC : resolve(position, cities)
  DUC --> B : City
  B -> B : emit(selectedCityId: city.id,\n  gpsStatus: success,\n  gpsMessage: "Ciudad detectada: …")
  B --> S : new state
  S -> U : city preselected, notice and button hidden
end

@enduml
